@startuml state-certificate
!theme plain
title Certificate lifecycle

[*] --> Requested : CSR submitted /\nkeygen requested
Requested --> Rejected : auth failure /\npolicy violation /\ninvalid CSR
Rejected --> [*]
Requested --> Active : signed by intermediate,\nrecorded + audited
Active --> Revoked : revoke(reason)\n→ CRL re-signed
Active --> Expired : now > notAfter
Revoked --> Expired : now > notAfter\n(dropped from CRL)
Expired --> [*]

Active : verify → valid
Active : status API → good
Revoked : verify → invalid
Revoked : listed on CRL
Expired : verify → invalid
Expired : renewal = new request
@enduml
